{"id": "20462074", "revid": "51051135", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20462074", "title": "Posten Cup", "text": "The Posten Cup, formerly known as the M\u00f8belringen Cup and Intersport Cup, is an annual women's handball tournament arranged by the Norwegian Handball Federation. Norway plus three invited national teams compete for the title, normally in a single round-robin format.\nThe tournament is usually held in November, prior to the European or World Championship. It was first arranged in 2001, when the Norwegian Handball Federation reached an agreement with furniture company M\u00f8belringen. From 2019 to 2022 it was known as Intersport Cup, after which it was renamed to Posten Cup since 2023."}
